{"id":"CVE-2013-7040","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2014-05-19T14:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T17:53:45.848Z","description":"Python 2.7 before 3.4 only uses the last eight bits of the prefix to randomize hash values, which causes it to compute hash values without restricting the ability to trigger hash collisions predictably and makes it easier for context-dependent attackers to cause a denial of service (CPU consumption) via crafted input to an application that maintains a hash table.  NOTE: this vulnerability exists because of an incomplete fix for CVE-2012-1150.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/64194","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"64194"},{"url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2013/12/09/13","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20131209 Re: CPython hash secret can be recoved remotely"},{"url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2013/12/09/3","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20131209 CPython hash secret can be recoved remotely"},{"url":"http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2015/Aug/msg00001.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_APPLE"],"name":"APPLE-SA-2015-08-13-2"},{"url":"http://bugs.python.org/issue14621","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://support.apple.com/kb/HT205031","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]}],"vendors":["python"]}
{"id":"CVE-2013-7338","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2014-04-22T14:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T18:01:20.402Z","description":"Python before 3.3.4 RC1 allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (infinite loop and CPU consumption) via a file size value larger than the size of the zip file to the (1) ZipExtFile.read, (2) ZipExtFile.read(n), (3) ZipExtFile.readlines, (4) ZipFile.extract, or (5) ZipFile.extractall function.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/592","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20140318 CVE request for python/zipfile"},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/65179","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"65179"},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2014-05/msg00008.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"openSUSE-SU-2014:0597"},{"url":"http://hg.python.org/cpython/rev/79ea4ce431b1","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201503-10","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_GENTOO"],"name":"GLSA-201503-10"},{"url":"http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2015/Aug/msg00001.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_APPLE"],"name":"APPLE-SA-2015-08-13-2"},{"url":"http://bugs.python.org/issue20078","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/595","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20140319 Re: CVE request for python/zipfile"},{"url":"https://support.apple.com/kb/HT205031","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1029973","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_SECTRACK"],"name":"1029973"},{"url":"https://docs.python.org/3.3/whatsnew/changelog.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]}],"vendors":["python"]}
